POST {{baseUrl}}/contribution-proposals/{{submittedContributionProposal.response.body.$.id}}/withdraw
Authorization: Bearer {{contributorLogin.response.body.$.tokens.accessToken}}
Idempotency-Key: 00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000006
Content-Type: application/json

{}


### 37 - Accept a Contribution Proposal into an attributed draft Request
POST {{baseUrl}}/contribution-proposals/{{submittedContributionProposal.response.body.$.id}}/accept
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerLogin.response.body.$.tokens.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "idempotencyKey": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000007"
}


### 38 - Decline a Contribution Proposal with a contributor-visible reason
